{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Exif Clean 是一款專為相片私隱而設的工具，可在裝置本機完成 HEIC、JPEG、PNG 與 WebP 格式轉換，並一鍵移除相片中的定位、相機與裝置資料。無論是經常在社交平台分享相片的用戶，還是需要向客戶或團隊交付標準化檔案的專業人士，都相當合用。原價 US $1.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>本機處理杜絕私隱外洩</h2>\n<p>所有轉換與清除步驟均在本機完成，相片不會上傳至任何伺服器，亦沒有廣告干擾。除單張處理，程式支援批量轉換並可自訂輸出畫質，重新命名範本更具備即時預覽。完成後可匯出為 ZIP、儲存至 Files 或直接存回相片圖庫，在較新裝置上每張相片約需 300 毫秒。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-134-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-135-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-136-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-137-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-138-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Exif Clean-Remove Data Offline</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T21:58:57.907432+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":351,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T21:50:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T04:38:05.528909+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T21:57:41.802648+00:00","content_hash":"0464b886c49f2d572d3745548ecdbf6e94e88d839f4e47cc21cbc01ed857c4e2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}